    "description": "Muchataga moodu examples cheptha,⁣\n⁣\n1. Dandruff shampoo vadithe daridram podhu, alage kurchoni yedisthe yedhi radhu.⁣\n2. Biryani konte leg piece osthundhi ane guarantee ledhu, nuvu prayathninchev kabati gelavali ane rule ledhu.⁣\n3. Seetha ni yethuku poyeru ani Ramudu sanyasi ipoledhu, sanubuthi korukoledhu. Sketch yesedu, sadinchedu, Seetha ni malli intiki thechukunadu. ⁣\n⁣\nChudu saami, sanubuthi ante santhapam lekka, cinema lo end credits laga last ki expect cheyali kani, shop opening ki ochina kotha cinema heroine la mundhu undi swagathinchakudadhu. Chala bagodhu.⁣\n⁣\nSanubuthi tho problem entante, mindset marchesthadi. Chala mandhi odharudham ane thought lo sanubuthi chupistharu.⁣\n⁣\nFor example, nuvu interview clear cheyaledhu anuko ‘ponle ra, try cheshnav, bochudu company lu unai inka, chusukundham le’ ani anatam manesi ‘Neelo intha talent undi, endhuku ravatledho aa baghavantudike teliyali’ ani pusukuni oka mata anestharu.⁣\n⁣\nLeni poni feeling lu, devudu meedha kopalu penchukotaniki thappa inka dheniki paniki raav alanti matalu. ⁣\n⁣\nPeekal dhaka thagutham, peekal dhaka thintam, kani peekal dhaka kastapadalem. TV lo oche fair & lovely ad kante fast ga try chesina ventane gelicheyali. Anthe ga? Sollu sollu, yedava sollu.⁣\n⁣\nIdhigo ammai, mukyanga neeku, aashadam sale lo konukuna saree la katukoni teeragamaka sanubuthi ni, gelavalenu ane anumanam kante, gelipinche dhairyanni kolipothav ala chesthe. ⁣\n⁣\nDravid chepinatu run out ipokandi, sanubuthi ki paadeyandi cherama geetham. ⁣\n⁣\nP.S 1: Ante oka manishi badha lo unte odharchatam thappa ani nee state syllabus mindset adagachu. Paina chepinatu, nee odharpu yatro lo avatala manishiki gamyam meedha orpu peragali kani, maarpu ochi ‘M’ gudisipokudadhu.⁣\n⁣\nP.S 2: Nenu raaya, opika ledhu. Meeku nachina PS lu comment section lo meere rasukondi. #fakemuchatlu",
